cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Offlined Sea Charts, credit OpenStreetMap as below, together with this project."
type: dataset
title: "Offlined Sea Charts"
abstract: >-
  The sea marks of OpenStreetMap (lighthouses, buoys, beacons, harbours, anchorages and hazards) as one small
  pack per country, ready to use offline. A project of Offlined. Data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.
  Not for navigation.
authors:
